ough because there  was a lot to it from the business aspect  yeah absolutely I mean it's not one of  these careers that tons of people have  done it's not like farming like my  husband does where he's a fifth  generation farmer this is kind of a time  where vloggers are first generation  bloggers so it's not something that had  been done before so it's a lot of  learning on the go  very exciting tell us about really  quickly your new TV show farm so it's  next Sunday at 11 a.m. and it's going to  include food from all of my favorite  influences like my Jewish and Chinese  culture and the farm and it's gonna be  so much fun and there's gonna be a lot  of sprinkles - all right I love that all  right have enough sprinkle Molly yay as  you sign this dish you can hear this  meal with anyone past or present who  would it be  okay well it's Father's Day tomorrow I  was so gonna say my dad wonderful choice  chef Molly a thank you so much such a  pleasure and for more on chef Jay and  the dish head to our website at CBS this  morning calm

